---
title: CMN — Employee Lifecycle State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> FirstLogin : CreateAsync()\nIsFirstLogin = true\nIdentityUser created\nIsActive = true

    FirstLogin : FirstLogin\n(IsFirstLogin = true, IsActive = true)
    Active : Active\n(IsFirstLogin = false, IsActive = true)
    Deactivated : Deactivated\n(IsActive = false)\nIdentityUser lockout = MaxValue

    FirstLogin --> Active : LoginAsync() success\nIsFirstLogin = false
    Active --> Deactivated : UpdateDetailAsync(IsActive = false)\nUserManager.SetLockoutEnabled(true)\nUserManager.SetLockoutEndDate(MaxValue)
    Deactivated --> Active : UpdateDetailAsync(IsActive = true)\nUserManager.SetLockoutEndDate(null)

    note right of FirstLogin
        Employee.Code is the login username
        Employee.UserId links to IdentityUser
        Password set by IdentityManager
    end note

    note right of Deactivated
        Login blocked at IdentityManager level
        Employee record still exists in DB
        Counted in totalDeactiveEmployees
    end note

    note right of Active
        Login allowed (if lockout not set)
        Counted in totalActiveEmployees
        Can be assigned Positions + OrgUnit
    end note
